Trade Nation is looking for a Premium Account Executive (PAE) to build, develop, and maintain strong client relationships. In this role, you will be responsible for identifying, acquiring, and managing your own portfolio of Own Sourced (OS) Clients and Affiliated Clients, while delivering an exceptional level of service to one of Trade Nation’s most valuable client groups, our House Clients.

